[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":93},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","i7wo05llchgajevju3m1p09z8","revision",1,"title","亚马逊搜索顶部竞价策略误区","originalTitle","Top of Search converting better does NOT automatically mean crank the TOS modifier to 200%.","summary","搜索顶部转化率更高，并不自动意味着要把 TOS 溢价调至 200%。\n\n你仍需从可承受的 CPC 反向推导。\n\n没有竞价计算的展示位置溢价，很容易导致为点击支付过高费用。","reason","source",{"_9":86,"_87":88,"_89":90,"_91":39,"_92":-5},"links",{"_83":84,"_66":85},"publishedAt","2026-10-12T18:15:00.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T15:58:17.624Z","timelineAt","category","advertising","tags",[80,81,82],"score",22,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","Evan_Swanson_","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>Top of Search converting better does NOT automatically mean crank the TOS modifier to 200%.</p><p>You still have to work backward from the CPC you can afford.</p><p>Placement modifiers without bid math are a really easy way to accidentally pay way too much for a click.</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Evan Swanson","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[],"广告/运营","广告投放","亚马逊","aihot","/items/i7wo05llchgajevju3m1p09z8","https://x.com/Evan_Swanson_/status/2109709435895689486","x-evan-swanson","name","X · Evan Swanson","kind","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_94":95},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
